:: Start [nobr]
<div class="phone">
  <div class="header"><span>Move Your Body</span></div>
  <h1>A little movement goes a long way</h1>
  <p class="lead">
    Moving your body is one of the most powerful things you can do for your
    blood pressure. It does not take a gym or a hard workout. A gentle daily
    walk is enough.
  </p>
  <div class="primary-cta">
    <<button "Next">>
      <<goto "Why">>
    <</button>>
  </div>
</div>

:: Why [nobr]
<div class="phone">
  <div class="header"><span>Move Your Body</span></div>
  <p class="lead">
    When you move, your heart beats a little faster and your blood vessels open
    up to carry oxygen to your muscles. Done often, this keeps your vessels
    flexible, and flexible vessels let blood flow with less pressure.
  </p>
  <p class="lead">
    Pick a pace and distance that feel safe for you today. Showing up matters
    more than speed.
  </p>
  <div class="primary-cta">
    <<button "Next">>
      <<goto "Play">>
    <</button>>
  </div>
</div>

:: Play [nobr]
<div class="phone">
  <div class="header"><span>Move Your Body</span></div>
  <h1>How to play</h1>
  <p class="lead">🚶 <b>A short walk</b> — set a small goal you can reach.</p>
  <p class="lead">🐕 <b>Bring a companion</b> — walk alongside a friendly guide.</p>
  <p class="lead">📈 <b>Watch progress grow</b> — a bar fills as you go.</p>
  <p class="lead"><i>You set a small goal, then the app follows along as you walk and fills a progress bar. Reach the goal to finish.</i></p>
  <div class="primary-cta">
    <<button "See the games">>
      <<run
        try {
          if (window.FlutterBridge && window.FlutterBridge.postMessage) {
            window.FlutterBridge.postMessage(JSON.stringify({ type: "CCQ_OPEN_GAMES" }));
          }
        } catch (e) {}
      >>
    <</button>>
  </div>
</div>
